ts restored. Click the orange button to undo before closing this window.\',\n\'置顶模式：关\':\'Always on top: Off\',\'置顶模式：开\':\'Always on top: On\',\n\'已开启窗口置顶\':\'Always on top enabled\',\'已关闭窗口置顶\':\'Always on top disabled\',\n\'立即断开地图连接\':\'Disconnect from map\',\n\'立即发送游戏原生断开命令，退出当前地图和房间。\':\'Immediately send the native disconnect command to leave the map and room.\',\n\'正在发送立即断开命令…\':\'Sending disconnect command…\',\n\'已发送立即断开命令，正在确认连接状态…\':\'Disconnect command sent; checking connection state…\',\n\'已断开地图连接\':\'Disconnected from the map\',\n\'退出命令已发送，但游戏在 8 秒内未确认断开；按钮已恢复，可重试\':\'Disconnect sent but not confirmed within 8 seconds; you can retry.\',\n\'进入地图或加载途中均可请求返回等候游戏大厅。\':\'Return to the waiting room while joining, loading or playing.\',\n\'正在请求返回大厅…\':\'Requesting return to the waiting room…\',\n\'返回大厅请求已发送，正在等待游戏确认…\':\'Return requested; waiting for the game to confirm…\',\n\'已确认返回等候游戏大厅\':\'Returned to the waiting room\',\n\'游戏尚未确认返回大厅，仍在等待；同步加载期间需等引擎处理退出请求\':\'Still waiting for the game. Synchronous loading must yield before the request can run.\',\n\'已退出地图，但未回到等候房间；房间可能已关闭\':\'Map exited, but the waiting room was not reached; the room may have closed.\',\n\'客户端已关闭，无法确认返回大厅\':\'The client closed; returning to the room could not be confirmed.\',\n\'已经在等候游戏大厅\':\'Already in the waiting room\',\n\'指定 BOT SKIN\':\'Assign BOT skin\',\'我的阵营\':\'My team\',\'BOT 编号\':\'BOT slot\',\'SKIN 编号\':\'Skin ID\',\n\'应用\':\'Apply\',\'取消指定\':\'Clear assignment\',\'关闭窗口\':\'Close\',\'刷新 BOT 列表\':\'Refresh BOT list\',\n\'只修改同阵营的指定 BOT；下次出生生效。\':\'Only the selected allied BOT is changed, on its next spawn.\',\n\'当前没有同阵营 BOT\':\'No allied BOTs in this match\',\'先进入本地对局，再选择 BOT\':\'Enter a local match before selecting a BOT\',\n}\nEN[\'综合威胁：先排除墙体 / 地面遮挡 → 紧急近身 / 快速逼近（含侧后方）→ 手持投掷物 → 携带可用投掷物 → 视野内最靠近准星的敌人。仅按住右键生效。\']=\'COMBINED THREATS · Clear wall / ground trace required → urgent close / approaching threats (including flanks and rear) → held throwables → available throwables → nearest crosshair in view. Hold RMB to activate.\'\nEN[\'综合威胁：先选可击中射线（无遮挡 / 可穿透估算） → 紧急近身 / 快速逼近（含侧后方）→ 手持投掷物 → 携带可用投掷物 → 视野内最靠近准星的敌人。仅按住右键生效。\']=\'COMBINED THREATS · Reachable ray (clear or estimated penetration) → urgent close / approaching threats → held throwables → available throwables → nearest crosshair in view. Hold RMB to activate.\'\n\n\nEN.update({\'鼠标锁定中心：关\': \'Lock mouse to center: Off\', \'鼠标锁定中心：开\': \'Lock mouse to center: On\', \'鼠标锁定：关闭\': \'Mouse lock: Off\', \'鼠标锁定：等待游戏窗口前台\': \'Mouse lock: Waiting for game focus\', \'鼠标锁定：等待连接游戏\': \'Mouse lock: Waiting for game connection\', \'鼠标锁定：切换窗口时已释放\': \'Mouse lock: Released while switching windows\', \'鼠标锁定：已固定在游戏画面正中心\': \'Mouse lock: Fixed at game center\', \'鼠标锁定失败\': \'Mouse lock failed\', \'鼠标锁定已关闭\': \'Mouse lock disabled\', \'鼠标锁定：等待进入地图\': \'Mouse lock: Waiting to enter a map\', \'鼠标锁定：正在准备鼠标输入\': \'Mouse lock: Preparing mouse input\', \'鼠标锁定：游戏菜单中已释放\': \'Mouse lock: Released for game menu\', \'鼠标锁定已停止\': \'Mouse lock stopped\', \'鼠标锁定已开启：进入地图自动生效，ESC 菜单自动释放\': \'Mouse lock enabled: automatic in maps; released for the ESC menu\', \'鼠标锁定：正在准备鼠标输入\': \'Mouse lock: Preparing mouse input\', \'进入地图自动锁定中心；ESC、购买、选人等原生菜单、切出或退图时自动释放，回到对局恢复。\': \'Locks to the center in a map. ESC, buy, character selection and other native menus, switching apps or leaving a map release it; returning to play restores it.\'})\n\nclass LocalizedVar(tk.StringVar):\n    def __init__(self,owner,value=\'\'):\n        self.owner=owner;self.raw=str(value);super().__init__(owner.root,value=owner.t(value));owner.variables.append(self)\n    def set(self,value):\n        self.raw=str(value);rendered=self.owner.t(self.raw)\n        if self.get()!=rendered:super().set(rendered)\n    def refresh(self):\n        rendered=self.owner.t(self.raw)\n        if self.get()!=rendered:super().set(rendered)\n\n\nclass LanguageUI:\n    def __init__(self,root):\n        self.root=root;self.widgets=[];self.variables=[];self.combos=[];self.tabs=[];self.button=None;self.refreshers=[]\n        try:self.lang=\'zh\' if ctypes.windll.kernel32.GetUserDefaultUILanguage()&0x3ff==4 else \'en\'\n        except Exception:self.lang=\'en\'\n    def t(self,text):\n        text=str(text)\n        if self.lang==\'zh\':return text\n        if text in EN:return EN[text]\n        from ui_text import EN as EXTRA_EN,dynamic_english\n        if text in EXTRA_EN:return EXTRA_EN[text]\n        countdown=re.fullmatch(r\'(\\d+) 秒后开启雷达显示敌方功能\',text)\n        if countdown:return \'Enemy radar activates in \'+countdown.group(1)+\' seconds\'\n        if \'\\n\' in text:return \'\\n\'.join(self.t(line) for line in text.split(\'\\n\'))\n        dynamic=dynamic_english(text,self.t)\n        if dynamic is not None:return dynamic\n        for original,translated in sorted(EN.items(),key=lambda pair:len(pair[0]),reverse=True):\n            if text.startswith(original+\'：\'):return translated+\':\'+text[len(original)+1:]\n        substitutions={\'服务器 HP：\':\'Server HP:\',\' / 锁定 \':\' / lock \',\'房主工具：\':\'Host companion: \',\n            \'游戏就绪，\':\'game ready, \',\' 秒后启动\':\' s until launch\',\'已自动启动\':\'started automatically\',\'已运行\':\'already running\',\n            \'等待游戏就绪\':\'waiting for game readiness\',\'等待地图载入完成\':\'waiting for map loading\',\n            \'敌方 \':\'Opponents \',\'采样 \':\'read \',\'叠加 \':\'overlay \',\'受击 \':\'attacked \',\' 次\':\' times\',\'评分 \':\'score \',\n            \'持续日志：尚无确认命中事件\':\'Logging: no confirmed hit events\',\'本地主机全图同步开关已启用\':\'Local full-map synchronization enabled\',\n            \'游戏菜单中，辅助控制暂停\':\'Game menu open; controls paused\',\'等待游戏前台及有效数据\':\'Waiting for game focus and valid data\',\n            \'采样暂时过期，等待新数据\':\'Sample expired; waiting for fresh data\',\n            \'自动补敌人：\':\'Bot fill: \',\'关闭\':\'off\',\'当前没有存活的敌方实体\':\'No active opposing entities\',\n            \'综合威胁：等待当前无遮挡射线\':\'Combined threats: waiting for a fresh clear ray\',\n            \'未检测到 CounterStrikeOnline2.exe；可先使用离线预览\':\'Waiting for CounterStrikeOnline2.exe\',\n            \'已连接客户端，等待进入地图\':\'Connected; waiting for a map\',\'地图正在载入，等待角色生成\':\'Map loading; waiting for player spawn\'}\n        for a,b in substitutions.items():text=text.replace(a,b)\n        return text\n    def var(self,value=\'\'):return LocalizedVar(self,value)\n    def combo(self,parent,canonical,values):\n        view=tk.StringVar(value=self.t(canonical.get()));box=ttk.Combobox(parent,textvariable=view,state=\'readonly\',exportselection=False)\n        self.combos.append((box,canonical,view,list(values)))\n        def sync(*_):view.set(self.t(canonical.get()))\n        canonical.trace_add(\'write\',sync)\n        def select(_):\n            i=box.current()\n            if 0<=i<len(values):canonical.set(values[i])\n            box.selection_clear()\n        box.bind(\'<<ComboboxSelected>>\',select)\n        box.bind(\'<FocusOut>\',lambda _:box.selection_clear())\n        def popup_style():\n            popup=box.tk.call(\'ttk::combobox::PopdownWindow\',str(box))\n            box.tk.call(str(popup)+\'.f.l\',\'configure\',\'-background\',\'#0b2038\',\'-foreground\',TEXT,\n                        \'-selectbackground\',\'#205d9d\',\'-selectforeground\',\'#d3e7ff\',\n                        \'-highlightthickness\',0,\'-borderwidth\',0,\'-font\',(\'Microsoft YaHei UI\',10))\n        box.configure(values=[self.t(v) for v in values],postcommand=popup_style);return box\n    def capture(self,widget):\n        if isinstance(widget,ttk.Notebook):\n            for tab in widget.tabs():self.tabs.append((widget,tab,widget.tab(tab,\'text\')))\n        try:\n            raw=getattr(widget,\'_i18n_raw_text\',widget.cget(\'text\'))\n            if raw and widget is not self.button and not widget.cget(\'textvariable\'):self.widgets.append((widget,raw))\n        except tk.TclError:pass\n        for child in widget.winfo_children():self.capture(child)\n    def refresh(self):\n        for widget,text in self.widgets:widget.configure(text=self.t(text))\n        for var in self.variables:var.refresh()\n        for box,var,view,values in self.combos:box.configure(values=[self.t(v) for v in values]);view.set(self.t(var.get()))\n        for notebook,tab,text in self.tabs:notebook.tab(tab,text=self.t(text))\n        if self.button:self.button.configure(text=\'English\' if self.lang==\'zh\' else \'中文\')\n        for refresh in self.refreshers:refresh()\n    def toggle(self):self.lang=\'en\' if self.lang==\'zh\' else \'zh\';self.refresh()\n\n\ndef install_blue_style(root):\n    style=ttk.Style(root);style.theme_use(\'clam\')\n    style.configure(\'.\',font=(\'Microsoft YaHei UI\',10),background=PANEL,foreground=TEXT,borderwidth=0)\n    style.configure(\'TFrame\',background=PANEL)\n    style.configure(\'TLabel\',background=PANEL,foreground=LABEL)\n    style.configure(\'TButton\',background=\'#1d5daa\',foreground=\'#c7e1ff\',padding=(12,8),borderwidth=0,relief=\'flat\',focuscolor=BLUE)\n    style.map(\'TButton\',background=[(\'active\',\'#2675d6\'),(\'pressed\',\'#154c8d\')])\n    style.configure(\'UndoDefaults.TButton\',background=\'#e99a38\',foreground=\'#172332\',focuscolor=\'#172332\')\n    style.map(\'UndoDefaults.TButton\',background=[(\'pressed\',\'#c97720\'),(\'active\',\'#f7b453\'),(\'!disabled\',\'#e99a38\')],\n              foreground=[(\'!disabled\',\'#172332\')])\n    style.configure(\'TNotebook\',background=PANEL,borderwidth=0)\n    style.configure(\'TNotebook.Tab\',background=\'#163452\',foreground=\'#83add8\',padding=(8,8),borderwidth=0)\n    style.map(\'TNotebook.Tab\',background=[(\'selected\',\'#205d9d\')],foreground=[(\'selected\',\'#a8d5ff\')])\n    style.configure(\'TEntry\',fieldbackground=\'#0b2038\',foreground=TEXT,bordercolor=\'#29517a\',lightcolor=\'#29517a\',darkcolor=\'#29517a\',padding=6)\n    style.configure(\'TCombobox\',fieldbackground=\'#0b2038\',background=\'#173d63\',foreground=TEXT,arrowcolor=LABEL,\n                    bordercolor=\'#29517a\',lightcolor=\'#29517a\',darkcolor=\'#29517a\',\n                    selectbackground=\'#0b2038\',selectforeground=TEXT,arrowsize=14,padding=(7,6))\n    style.map(\'TCombobox\',fieldbackground=[(\'readonly\',\'#0b2038\')],foreground=[(\'readonly\',TEXT)],\n              selectbackground=[(\'readonly\',\'#0b2038\')],selectforeground=[(\'readonly\',TEXT)],\n              bordercolor=[(\'focus\',\'#3288ff\'),(\'!focus\',\'#29517a\')],\n              lightcolor=[(\'focus\',\'#3288ff\'),(\'!focus\',\'#29517a\')],\n              darkcolor=[(\'focus\',\'#3288ff\'),(\'!focus\',\'#29517a\')])\n    for option,value in ((\'background\',\'#0b2038\'),(\'foreground\',TEXT),(\'selectBackground\',\'#205d9d\'),\n                         (\'selectForeground\',\'#d3e7ff\'),(\'font\',(\'Microsoft YaHei UI\',10)),\n                         (\'borderWidth\',0),(\'highlightThickness\',0)):\n        root.option_add(\'*TCombobox*Listbox.\'+option,value)\n    style.layout(\'Vertical.TScrollbar\',[(\'Vertical.Scrollbar.trough\',{\'sticky\':\'ns\',\'children\':[\n        (\'Vertical.Scrollbar.thumb\',{\'expand\':\'1\',\'sticky\':\'nswe\'})]})])\n    style.configure(\'Vertical.TScrollbar\',background=\'#31689e\',troughcolor=PANEL,bordercolor=PANEL,\n                    lightcolor=\'#31689e\',darkcolor=\'#31689e\',arrowcolor=PANEL,width=10,borderwidth=0)\n    style.map(\'Vertical.TScrollbar\',background=[(\'active\',\'#4c99e6\'),(\'pressed\',BLUE)])\n    unchecked=tk.PhotoImage(master=root,width=20,height=20);checked=tk.PhotoImage(master=root,width=20,height=20)\n    for image,color in ((unchecked,\'#183d65\'),(checked,BLUE)):\n        image.put(color,to=(1,1,19,19))\n    unchecked.put(\'#658bb4\',to=(1,1,19,2));unchecked.put(\'#658bb4\',to=(1,18,19,19))\n    unchecked.put(\'#658bb4\',to=(1,1,2,19));unchecked.put(\'#658bb4\',to=(18,1,19,19))\n    for a,b in (((5,10),(9,14)),((9,14),(16,6))):\n        n=max(abs(a[0]-b[0]),abs(a[1]-b[1]))\n        for j in range(n+1):\n            x=round(a[0]+(b[0]-a[0])*j/n);y=round(a[1]+(b[1]-a[1])*j/n)\n            checked.put(\'#eef7ff\',to=(x-1,y-1,x+2,y+2))\n    root._check_images=(unchecked,checked)\n    style.element_create(\'BlueCheck.indicator\',\'image\',unchecked,(\'selected\',checked),width=24,sticky=\'w\')\n    style.layout(\'TCheckbutton\',[(\'Checkbutton.padding\',{\'sticky\':\'nswe\',\'children\':[\n        (\'BlueCheck.indicator\',{\'side\':\'left\',\'sticky\':\'w\'}),(\'Checkbutton.label\',{\'side\':\'left\',\'sticky\':\'nswe\'})]})])\n    style.configure(\'TCheckbutton\',background=PANEL,foreground=TEXT,padding=(0,6),wraplength=304,focuscolor=PANEL)\n    style.map(\'TCheckbutton\',background=[(\'active\',PANEL)],foreground=[(\'active\',\'#d0e4ff\')])\n    return style\n\n\nclass BlueScrollbar(tk.Canvas):\n    """Slim rounded thumb with drag and track-click support; no native arrows."""\n    def __init__(self,parent,command):\n        super().__init__(parent,width=12,height=1,bg=PANEL,highlightthickness=0,takefocus=False)\n        self.command=command;self.first=0.;self.last=1.;self.drag=None;self.hover=False\n        self.bind(\'<Configure>\',lambda _:self.draw())\n        self.bind(\'<Enter>\',lambda _:self.highlight(True));self.bind(\'<Leave>\',lambda _:self.highlight(False))\n        self.bind(\'<Button-1>\',self.press);self.bind(\'<B1-Motion>\',self.move)\n        self.bind(\'<ButtonRelease-1>\',self.release)\n    def set(self,first,last):self.first=float(first);self.last=float(last);self.draw()\n    def bounds(self):\n        extent=max(1,self.winfo_height()-12);size=min(extent,max(32,extent*(self.last-self.first)))\n        top=6+(extent-size)*self.first/max(.00001,1-(self.last-self.first))\n        return top,size,extent\n    def highlight(self,value):self.hover=value;self.draw()\n    def draw(self):\n        self.delete(\'all\')\n        if self.last-self.first>=.999:return\n        top,size,_=self.bounds();x=self.winfo_width()/2\n        self.create_line(x,top+4,x,top+size-4,fill=BLUE if self.drag is not None else \'#4c99e6\' if self.hover else \'#31689e\',width=7,capstyle=\'round\')\n    def press(self,event):\n        if self.last-self.first>=.999:return\n        top,size,_=self.bounds()\n        self.drag=event.y-top if top<=event.y<=top+size else size/2\n        self.move(event)\n    def move(self,event):\n        if self.drag is None:return\n        _,size,extent=self.bounds()\n        fraction=(event.y-6-self.drag)/max(1,extent-size)*(1-self.last+self.first)\n        self.command(\'moveto\',max(0.,min(1.,fraction)));self.draw()\n    def release(self,_):self.drag=None;self.draw()\n\n\nclass ScrollPage(ttk.Frame):\n    def __init__(self,parent):\n        super().__init__(parent)\n        self.wheel_remainder=0.\n        canvas=self.canvas=tk.Canvas(self,bg=PANEL,highlightthickness=0,width=340,yscrollincrement=24)\n        bar=self.bar=BlueScrollbar(self,command=canvas.yview)\n        canvas.configure(yscrollcommand=bar.set);bar.pack(side=\'right\',fill=\'y\');canvas.pack(side=\'left\',fill=\'both\',expand=True)\n        self.body=ttk.Frame(canvas,padding=8);window=canvas.create_window(0,0,window=self.body,anchor=\'nw\')\n        self.body.bind(\'<Configure>\',lambda _:canvas.configure(scrollregion=canvas.bbox(\'all\')))\n        canvas.bind(\'<Configure>\',lambda event:canvas.itemconfigure(window,width=event.width))\n    def wheel(self,event):\n        self.wheel_remainder+=-event.delta/120.*3\n        units=int(self.wheel_remainder);self.wheel_remainder-=units\n        if units:self.canvas.yview_scroll(units,\'units\')\n        return \'break\'\n\n\ndef install_pointer_interactions(root):\n    """Handle wheel input on widgets without replacing their native bindtags."""\n    def wheel(event):\n        try:widget=root.winfo_containing(event.x_root,event.y_root)\n        except tk.TclError:widget=event.widget\n        if widget is None:widget=event.widget\n        while widget is not None:\n            if isinstance(widget,ScrollPage):return widget.wheel(event)\n            widget=widget.master\n    def clear_selection(event):\n        for box in getattr(root,\'_ui_combos\',[]):\n            try:\n                if box is not event.widget:box.selection_clear()\n            except tk.TclError:pass\n        if isinstance(event.widget,(tk.Frame,ttk.Frame,tk.Label,ttk.Label)) or event.widget is root:\n            root.focus_set()\n    if not getattr(root,\'_pointer_root_installed\',False):\n        root.bind(\'<Button-1>\',clear_selection,add=\'+\');root._pointer_root_installed=True\n    def visit(widget):\n        widget.bindtags(tuple(tag for tag in widget.bindtags() if not str(tag).startswith(\'PointerPage\')))\n        if getattr(widget,\'_pointer_installed\',False):\n            for child in widget.winfo_children():visit(child)\n            return\n        widget._pointer_installed=True\n        widget.bind(\'<MouseWheel>\',wheel,add=\'+\')\n        if isinstance(widget,(ttk.Button,ttk.Checkbutton,ttk.Combobox,BlueSlider,BlueScrollbar)):\n            def record(event):\n                callback=getattr(root,\'_ui_action\',None)\n                if callback:callback(event)\n            widget.bind(\'<ButtonRelease-1>\',record,add=\'+\')\n        for child in widget.winfo_children():visit(child)\n    visit(root)\n\n\nclass EqualTabs(ttk.Frame):\n    """Four equal navigation cells; selection changes color, never dimensions."""\n    def __init__(self,parent):\n        super().__init__(parent);self.pages=[];self.buttons=[];self.current=0\n        style=ttk.Style(self)\n        style.configure(\'Nav.TButton\',padding=(4,10),background=\'#153958\',foreground=\'#80b0dc\',anchor=\'center\')\n        style.configure(\'Nav.Active.TButton\',padding=(4,10),background=\'#2264a7\',foreground=\'#b6dcff\',anchor=\'center\')\n        style.map(\'Nav.TButton\',background=[(\'active\',\'#204d78\')])\n        style.map(\'Nav.Active.TButton\',background=[(\'active\',\'#2873bd\')])\n        for i in range(4):self.columnconfigure(i,weight=1,uniform=\'pages\')\n        self.rowconfigure(1,weight=1)\n    def add(self,page,text):\n        index=len(self.pages);self.pages.append(page)\n        button=ttk.Button(self,text=text,style=\'Nav.TButton\',command=lambda:self.select(index))\n        button.grid(row=0,column=index,sticky=\'nsew\',padx=(0,1),pady=(0,8));self.buttons.append(button)\n        if index==0:self.select(0)\n    def select(self,index):\n        self.current=index\n        for i,(page,button) in enumerate(zip(self.pages,self.buttons)):\n            button.configure(style=\'Nav.Active.TButton\' if i==index else \'Nav.TButton\')\n            if i==index:page.grid(row=1,column=0,columnspan=4,sticky=\'nsew\')\n            else:page.grid_remove()\n\n\nclass BlueSlider(tk.Canvas):\n    def __init__(self,parent,variable,start,end):\n        super().__init__(parent,height=28,bg=PANEL,highlightthickness=0,takefocus=True)\n        self.variable=variable;self.start=start;self.end=end\n        self.bind(\'<Configure>\',lambda _:self.draw());variable.trace_add(\'write\',lambda *_:self.draw())\n        self.bind(\'<Button-1>\',self.move);self.bind(\'<B1-Motion>\',self.move)\n        self.bind(\'<Left>\',lambda _:self.shift(-1));self.bind(\'<Right>\',lambda _:self.shift(1))\n        self.bind(\'<Home>\',lambda _:variable.set(start));self.bind(\'<End>\',lambda _:variable.set(end))\n    def shift(self,direction):self.variable.set(max(self.start,min(self.end,self.variable.get()+direction*(self.end-self.start)/100)))\n    def move(self,event):\n        self.focus_set();fraction=max(0.,min(1.,(event.x-9)/max(1,self.winfo_width()-18)))\n        self.variable.set(round(self.start+(self.end-self.start)*fraction,2))\n    def draw(self):\n        self.delete(\'all\');width=max(20,self.winfo_width());y=14\n        x=9+(width-18)*max(0.,min(1.,(float(self.variable.get())-self.start)/(self.end-self.start)))\n        self.create_line(9,y,width-9,y,fill=\'#204b77\',width=6,capstyle=\'round\')\n        if x>9:self.create_line(9,y,x,y,fill=BLUE,width=6,capstyle=\'round\')\n        self.create_oval(x-7,y-7,x+7,y+7,fill=\'#68acff\',outline=\'#9bcaff\',width=1)\n\n\nclass SkinDialog(tk.Toplevel):\n    def __init__(self,parent,i18n,selection,request):\n        super().__init__(parent);prepare_hidden_window(self)\n        self.i18n=i18n;self.selection=selection;self.request=request;self.snapshot=None\n        self._ui_action=getattr(parent,\'_ui_action\',None)\n        self.title(i18n.t(\'指定 BOT SKIN\'));self.configure(bg=PANEL);self.transient(parent)\n        self.resizable(False,False)\n        body=ttk.Frame(self,padding=18);body.pack(fill=\'both\',expand=True)\n        self.team=tk.StringVar();self.bot=tk.StringVar();self.skin=tk.StringVar();self.note=tk.StringVar()\n        self.boxes=[]\n        for label,var in ((\'我的阵营\',self.team),(\'BOT 编号\',self.bot),(\'SKIN 编号\',self.skin)):\n            ttk.Label(body,text=i18n.t(label)).pack(anchor=\'w\',pady=(6,5))\n            box=ttk.Combobox(body,textvariable=var,state=\'readonly\',width=34,exportselection=False)\n            box.bind(\'<<ComboboxSelected>>\',lambda event:(event.widget.selection_clear(),self.remember()))\n            box.bind(\'<FocusOut>\',lambda event:event.widget.selection_clear())\n            box.pack(fill=\'x\');self.boxes.append(box)\n        ttk.Label(body,textvariable=self.note,wraplength=330,justify=\'left\').pack(fill=\'x\',pady=12)\n        row=ttk.Frame(body);row.pack(fill=\'x\')\n        ttk.Button(row,text=i18n.t(\'应用\'),command=self.apply).pack(side=\'left\',expand=True,fill=\'x\')\n        ttk.Button(row,text=i18n.t(\'取消指定\'),command=lambda:self.send(\'skin_clear\')).pack(side=\'left\',padx=(8,0))\n        ttk.Button(body,text=i18n.t(\'刷新 BOT 列表\'),command=lambda:self.send(\'skin_roster\')).pack(fill=\'x\',pady=(8,0))\n        self.note.set(i18n.t(\'先连接游戏并进入本地对局，再刷新 BOT 列表\'))\n        self.geometry(f\'+{parent.winfo_rootx()+80}+{parent.winfo_rooty()+100}\')\n        install_pointer_interactions(self);reveal_ready_window(self)\n    def remember(self):\n        for key,var in ((\'team\',self.team),(\'bot\',self.bot),(\'skin\',self.skin)):\n            try:value=int(var.get().split()[0].lstrip(\'#\'))\n            except (ValueError,IndexError):continue\n            self.selection[key]=value\n    def send(self,command,argument=None):\n        self.note.set(self.i18n.t(\'正在处理…\'));self.request(command,argument)\n    def load(self,snapshot):\n        oldbot=self.bot.get().split(\' · \')[0];oldskin=self.skin.get().split(\' · \')[0]\n        self.snapshot=snapshot;team=snapshot[\'team\']\n        self.roster=[r for r in snapshot[\'bots\'] if r[\'team\']==team]\n        self.choices=[r for r in snapshot[\'skins\'] if r[\'team\']==team]\n        teamtext=\'2 · T\' if team==2 else \'3 · CT\'\n        self.boxes[0].configure(values=[teamtext]);self.team.set(teamtext)\n        botvalues=[f"#{r[\'index\']} · SKIN {r[\'current\']}" for r in self.roster]\n        skinvalues=[f"{r[\'id\']} · {r[\'name\']}" for r in self.choices]\n        for box,var,values,previous in ((self.boxes[1],self.bot,botvalues,oldbot or \'#\'+str(self.selection.get(\'bot\',\'\'))),\n                                        (self.boxes[2],self.skin,skinvalues,oldskin or str(self.selection.get(\'skin\',\'\')))):\n            box.configure(values=values)\n            var.set(next((v for v in values if v.split(\' · \')[0]==previous),values[0] if values else \'\'))\n        self.note.set(self.i18n.t(\'只修改同阵营的指定 BOT；下次出生生效。\' if self.roster and self.choices\n                      else \'当前没有同阵营 BOT\' if not self.roster else \'当前没有可用 SKIN，请刷新列表\'))\n    def apply(self):\n        if not self.snapshot or not self.bot.get() or not self.skin.get():\n            self.note.set(self.i18n.t(\'请先刷新并选择同阵营 BOT 和 SKIN\'));return\n        try:\n            index=int(self.bot.get().split(\' · \')[0][1:]);skin=int(self.skin.get().split(\' · \')[0])\n            row=next(r for r in self.roster if r[\'index\']==index)\n            if not any(r[\'id\']==skin for r in self.choices):raise ValueError(\'SKIN\')\n        except (ValueError,StopIteration):\n            self.note.set(self.i18n.t(\'选择已失效，请刷新 BOT 列表\'));return\n        self.send(\'skin_apply\',dict(row,team=self.snapshot[\'team\'],skin=skin,map=self.snapshot[\'map\']))\n\n\ndef dark_titlebar(root):\n    try:\n        hwnd=ctypes.windll.user32.GetParent(root.winfo_id())\n        for attr,value in ((20,1),(35,0x2d1908),(36,0xffb579)):\n            v=ctypes.c_int(value);ctypes.windll.dwmapi.DwmSetWindowAttribute(hwnd,attr,ctypes.byref(v),4)\n    except Exception:pass\n\n\ndef prepare_hidden_window(root):\n    """Build while withdrawn; never cloak the Tk content HWND or layer the UI."""\n    root.withdraw()\n    root.configure(bg=BG)\n\n\ndef reveal_ready_window(root,zoomed=False):\n    # Tk can create/reparent its native wrapper while mapping. Keeping a HWND\n    # captured before mapping can leave the content window cloaked separately.\n    # Use the normal Tk lifecycle so input reaches the actual child controls.\n    root.update_idletasks()\n    dark_titlebar(root)\n    root.deiconify()\n    if zoomed:root.state(\'zoomed\')\n    root.update_idletasks()\n    dark_titlebar(root)\n\n\nclass ColoredLegend(tk.Text):\n    """Noninteractive, localized legend with semantic colors and natural wrapping."""\n    def __init__(self,parent,i18n,rows):\n        super().__init__(parent,bg=\'#101b29\',fg=LABEL,font=(\'Microsoft YaHei UI\',12),\n                         borderwidth=0,highlightthickness=0,padx=0,pady=0,spacing1=1,spacing3=2,\n                         width=1,height=len(rows),wrap=\'word\',takefocus=0,cursor=\'arrow\',state=\'disabled\')\n        # Behave like a label: no editing, caret, selection or internal scrolling.\n        self.bindtags(tuple(tag for tag in self.bindtags() if tag!=\'Text\'))\n        self._fit_job=None\n        self._phrases={\n            \'red\':(\'投掷物在手为红色\',\'Holding a throwable: red\',\'投掷物在手显示红色骨骼\',\'holding a throwable shows a red skeleton\'),\n            \'green\':(\'无投掷物的为绿色\',\'otherwise green\',\'对应颜色的骨骼\',\'matching-color skeleton\'),\n            \'yellow\':(\'加大红黄警告箭头+感叹号\',\'enlarged red/yellow warning arrow + exclamation mark\',\n                      \'显示黄色警告箭头+感叹号，随距离提示标逐渐放大\',\'yellow warning arrow + exclamation mark, growing progressively with proximity\')}\n        for name,color in ((\'red\',\'#ff4c61\'),(\'green\',\'#55e28c\'),(\'yellow\',\'#ffd54a\'),(\'muted\',MUTED)):\n            self.tag_configure(name,foreground=color)\n        self._row_vars=[i18n.var(text) for text in rows]\n        self._traces=[(var,var.trace_add(\'write\',self._render)) for var in self._row_vars]\n        self.bind(\'<Configure>\',lambda event:self._schedule_fit())\n        self._render()\n\n    def _render(self,*_):\n        self.configure(state=\'normal\');self.delete(\'1.0\',\'end\')\n        self.insert(\'1.0\',\'\\n\'.join(var.get() for var in self._row_vars))\n        for name,phrases in self._phrases.items():\n            for phrase in phrases:\n                start=self.search(phrase,\'1.0\',stopindex=\'end\',exact=True)\n                if start:self.tag_add(name,start,start+\'+%dc\'%len(phrase))\n        self.configure(state=\'disabled\');self._schedule_fit()\n\n    def _schedule_fit(self):\n        if self._fit_job is None:self._fit_job=self.winfo_toplevel().after_idle(self._fit)\n\n    def _fit(self):\n        self._fit_job=None\n        if self.winfo_width()<=1:return\n        count=self.count(\'1.0\',\'end-1c\',\'displaylines\')\n        height=max(len(self._row_vars),1+(count[0] if count else 0))\n        if int(self.cget(\'height\'))!=height:self.configure(height=height)\n\n    def destroy(self):\n        if self._fit_job is not None:self.winfo_toplevel().after_cancel(self._fit_job);self._fit_job=None\n        for var,trace in self._traces:var.trace_remove(\'write\',trace)\n        super().destroy()\n\n\n\nclass WallResourceNotice(tk.Text):\n    """Two-line bold yellow-to-red notice below the radar legend, no frame."""\n    def __init__(self,parent,translate=lambda text:text,max_lines=None):\n        super().__init__(parent,bg=\'#101b29\',fg=\'#ffd54a\',font=(\'Microsoft YaHei UI\',12,\'bold\'),\n            borderwidth=0,highlightthickness=0,padx=0,pady=0,spacing1=2,spacing3=3,\n            width=1,height=2,wrap=\'char\',takefocus=0,cursor=\'arrow\',state=\'disabled\')\n        self.bindtags(tuple(tag for tag in self.bindtags() if tag!=\'Text\'))\n        self.lines=();self.raw_lines=();self.translate=translate;self.fit_job=None;self.max_lines=max_lines\n        if max_lines:\n            self.bind(\'<MouseWheel>\',lambda e:(self.yview_scroll(-1 if e.delta>0 else 1,\'units\'),\'break\')[-1])\n        self.bind(\'<Configure>\',lambda event:self.schedule_fit())\n\n    def set_lines(self,lines):\n        self.raw_lines=tuple(lines)\n        lines=tuple(self.translate(line) for line in self.raw_lines)\n        if lines==self.lines:return\n        self.lines=lines\n        self.configure(state=\'normal\');self.delete(\'1.0\',\'end\')\n        for tag in self.tag_names():\n            if tag!=\'sel\':self.tag_delete(tag)\n        if not lines:\n            self.configure(state=\'disabled\');self.pack_forget();return\n        from wall_capability import gradient_color\n        for row,line in enumerate(lines,1):\n            if row>1:self.insert(\'end\',\'\\n\')\n            self.insert(\'end\',line)\n            for col,char in enumerate(line):\n                tag=\'gradient_\'+str(col)+\'_\'+str(len(line))\n                self.tag_configure(tag,foreground=gradient_color(col,len(line)))\n                self.tag_add(tag,f\'{row}.{col}\',f\'{row}.{col+1}\')\n        self.configure(state=\'disabled\')\n        self.pack(anchor=\'w\',fill=\'x\',pady=(9,0))\n        self.schedule_fit()\n\n    def refresh(self):\n        self.set_lines(self.raw_lines)\n\n    def schedule_fit(self):\n        if self.fit_job is None:self.fit_job=self.after_idle(self.fit)\n\n    def fit(self):\n        self.fit_job=None\n        if not self.lines or self.winfo_width()<=1:return\n        count=self.count(\'1.0\',\'end-1c\',\'displaylines\')\n        height=max(len(self.lines),1+(count[0] if count else 0))\n        if self.max_lines:height=min(self.max_lines,height)\n        if int(self.cget(\'height\'))!=height:self.configure(height=height)\n\n    def destroy(self):\n        if self.fit_job is not None:self.after_cancel(self.fit_job)\n        super().destroy()\n')




